---
// 담당 영역 지도. 비율 대신 "시스템의 어느 칸이 내 것인지"를 보여 준다.
interface Item { name: string; owner: "me" | "team" | "shared"; note?: string }
interface Props { areas: { group: string; items: Item[] }[] }
const { areas } = Astro.props;

const style = {
  me: "text-white border-transparent",
  shared: "bg-white border-2 text-gray-900",
  team: "bg-white border border-dashed border-gray-300 text-gray-500",
};
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded" style="background-color: var(--accent)"></span>제가 맡은 것</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded border-2" style="border-color: var(--accent)"></span>함께 한 것</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded border border-dashed border-gray-400"></span>팀원이 맡은 것</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
    {
      areas.map((a) => (
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-start">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 sm:pt-3">{a.group}</h4>
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
            {a.items.map((it) => (
              <li
                class={`rounded-xl px-4 py-3 ${style[it.owner]}`}
                style={it.owner === "me" ? "background-color: var(--accent)" : it.owner === "shared" ? "border-color: var(--accent)" : ""}
              >
                <span class="block font-semibold text-[0.9375rem]">{it.name}</span>
                {it.note && <span class={`block text-xs mt-0.5 ${it.owner === "me" ? "text-white/80" : "text-gray-500"}`}>{it.note}</span>}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</div>
